# Data sheets use Glide Data Grid

Glide Data Grid (`@glideapps/glide-data-grid`, https://docs.grid.glideapps.com/) is the default way to view and edit data sheets.

- New sheet UI goes on Glide, including the blank-dashboard **Add data sheet** flow.
- Do not add AG Grid (`ag-grid-react`) to new work, and do not extend existing AG Grid screens unless the user explicitly asks.
- Leave current AG Grid code in place until the user asks to phase it out. That migration is later, one step at a time.
